// Service worker for Embercrown: The Hold (owner J). Versioned cache-first storage of every game
// file, so the game plays offline after the first visit. Bump VERSION on every release and run
// `node tools/check-sw.mjs --write` after adding or removing a shipped file.
// /classic/ (the frozen roguelite) is never cached: its requests go straight to the network (13.5).
// Nothing from tools/ ships or is cached.
